<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Limite atteinte</title>
  <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/images/icone.ico" type="image/x-icon">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f7faff;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100vh;
      margin: 0;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      background: white;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 500px;
      border: 2px solid #ff4d4d;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #ff4d4d;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #1976d2;
      color: white;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: background 0.3s;
    }
    a:hover {
      background-color: #1565c0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Limite de tentatives atteinte</h1>
    <p>Vous avez atteint le nombre maximum de tentatives autorisées pour le deck <strong>{{ deck.title }}</strong>.</p>
    <a href="{{ route('home') }}">Retour à l'accueil</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
